factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  The reel_script says the staircase collapse happened in Venkamedu village area ('வெங்கமேடு அருகே வீட்டின் மாடி படிக்கட்டு'), but the article says the house is in Pudhu Kulathupalayam near Venkamedu; the headline and slide wording also merge these, so the location is slightly misstated.
  The reel_script and caption say the injured man was injured in the 'வீட்டின் படிக்கட்டு' area and the reel_script says the staircase fell on the house of 'லோகநாதனின் வீட்டு ஓட்டின் மேல்' while the article says Peer Mohammed was the tenant of the tiled house; the reel_script omits that he was a tenant in the house that was hit, which is an important detail of the event.
  The slides_spec line 'லோகநாதனின் வீட்டு ஓடு உடைந்தது' (Loganathan's roof tiles broke) is an inference not stated in the article, which only says the staircase fell on the roof.
  The slides_spec lists 'கீழிருந்த ஓட்டு வீட்டின் மேல் படிக்கட்டு விழுந்தது' and the reel_script describes the house owner as Jeeva, but the slide says the collapsed staircase 'இடிந்த படிக்கட்டு வீட்டின் உரிமையாளர் ஜீவாவுக்கு சொந்தமானது', which is consistent; however the caption's 'வீட்டின் படிக்கட்டு' omits that it was Jeeva's house, so it is less specific but not false.
  The slides_spec 'இடவாரியான மழை' slide's last line is truncated/ungrammatical ('மயிலம்பட்டியில் <b>1.50' with no unit and no closing tag), so the text is incomplete and has no clear meaning as written.
  The reel_script states 'நேற்று முன்தினம் இரவு முதல் நேற்று அதிகாலை வரை மழை நீடித்தது' and also the caption repeats this, while the sentence before says rain fell until early morning yesterday; the timing is consistent with the article, so no error here, but the reel_script omits the article's stated cause that a low-pressure trough over the southwest Bay of Bengal caused rain across Tamil Nadu for four days.
